{"id":1196202,"vol":{"id":177365,"name":"G.I. Joe: A Real American Hero/Tomb Raider"},"num":"1","name":"","title":"G.I. Joe: A Real American Hero/Tomb Raider #1","year":"2026","date":"2026-10-07","store":"2026-10-07","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/11161/111615891/10206128-cover.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/11161/111615891/10206128-cover.jpg","pub":"Image","deck":"","desc":"MINISERIES PREMIERE\n\nKNOWING IS HALF THE BATTLE.\n\nRAIDING IS THE OTHER HALF!\n\nG.I. JOE and LARA CROFT meet for THE FIRST TIME EVER in an all-new limited series from superstars KYLE HIGGINS (RADIANT BLACK) and ELENA CASAGRANDE (Black Widow) that reveals the classified connection between these pop culture icons.\n\nLara Croft has explored some of the most dangerous locations on Earth, but nothing as treacherous as Cobra Island. For this adventure, she'll need the help of her old acquaintance, Shipwreck, and several squads of Joes to mount a dangerous expedition into the heart of the island to recover a treasure that's been hidden there for decades. One that Destro and Baroness will do anything to get their hands on first...","people":[{"id":84177,"name":"Ace Continuado","role":"cover"},{"id":58480,"name":"Alex Guimar\u00e3es","role":"colorist, cover"},{"id":45714,"name":"Brian Denham","role":"cover"},{"id":3395,"name":"Brian Haberlin","role":"cover"},{"id":105047,"name":"Carla Cohen","role":"cover"},{"id":82166,"name":"Cedric Poulat","role":"cover"},{"id":67092,"name":"Chris Mooneyham","role":"cover"},{"id":44779,"name":"David Nakayama","role":"cover"},{"id":52529,"name":"Elena Casagrande","role":"artist, cover"},{"id":62822,"name":"Elias Chatzoudis","role":"cover"},{"id":119144,"name":"Francesco Tomaselli","role":"cover"},{"id":124833,"name":"Gabriele Di Caro","role":"cover"},{"id":125222,"name":"Godtail","role":"cover"},{"id":67987,"name":"In-Hyuk Lee","role":"cover"},{"id":137285,"name":"Jefter","role":"cover"},{"id":62847